# AI handoff

Read `ai/README.md`, then `ai/STATUS.md` and `ai/PLAN.md`.

If this chat is implementing: do only the **current work package** in `PLAN.md`. Do not add an SSG, re-plan, or pull extra backlog items.

If this chat is planning: update `PLAN.md`; do not implement unless the owner asks.

After work, update `ai/STATUS.md` and `ai/BACKLOG.md`. Do not restore `main-original.js`.
